{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_30de6234392e665c/index.md","canonical_url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-17T06:25:49Z","content_hash":"867c506a14ba1673f73d5d3200e0f0ca1e72c65d7a521ad6e6a575acf28ad631","evidence":[{"label":"GitHub repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench"},{"label":"Current window commit","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench/commit/6c79ccb35c8b8674552376063a04b1fbd497de6f"},{"label":"Gauntlet methodology","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench/blob/main/docs/gauntlet.md"},{"label":"Runner contract","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench/blob/main/docs/RUNNER.md"}],"external_id":"github:luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench@6c79ccb35c8b8674552376063a04b1fbd497de6f","fetched_at":"2026-08-17T06:25:49Z","fingerprint":"867c506a14ba1673f73d5d3200e0f0ca1e72c65d7a521ad6e6a575acf28ad631","id":"itm_30de6234392e665c","item_id":"itm_30de6234392e665c","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-17T01:49:13Z","reading_minutes":22,"score":91,"sort_at":"2026-08-17T01:49:13Z","source_id":"agent-egress-bench","source_name":"Agent Egress Bench","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"Agent Egress Bench 是一个评测 AI Agent 出站安全工具的开源攻击语料，而不是模型拒答基准；它把 URL、HTTP body、header、WebSocket、MCP、A2A 等 wire 输入送入代理、防火墙或 MCP wrapper，观察安全层是否阻断泄露、SSRF、工具投毒、链式外泄与编码规避。当前 loader 统计为 240 个逻辑 case、18 类，其中 174 个 block、65 个 allow、1 个 warn；Gauntlet 用 containment 与 false-positive rate 分开计分，并要求 exact transport、delivery proof、observable verdict、manifest digest 与配置证据。局限是它不证明模型 alignment、产品整体安全、认证合规或无 bypass，只证明给定 commit、runner、profile、transport 和配置下的出站控制表现。","tags":["AI安全","Agent安全","MCP","DLP","Benchmark","Egress"],"title":"Agent Egress Bench: Tool-neutral attack corpus for AI agent egress security","title_hash":"b74a10f88c191b6b2984fec6ccfd55872cbf79ea53893c2973ec759779ef25d6","type":"code","updated_at":"2026-08-17T06:11:47Z","url":"https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/agent-egress-bench"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_2f60ab2fa7499677/index.md","canonical_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-17T00:12:10Z","content_hash":"b1b8d7fbe3e67e5e8d8c00657efc80e002553d707dca24952695e3e78c5203d8","evidence":[{"label":"GitHub repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics"},{"label":"2026-08-17 commit evidence","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics/commit/e9883b6a8fd0b0e2da564e12992314984b93517f"},{"label":"Unified report source","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics/tree/main/papers/unified-report"},{"label":"Study registry","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics/blob/main/studies/registry.yaml"},{"label":"Canonical metrics implementation","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics/blob/main/guard_research/metrics.py"}],"external_id":"rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics@e9883b6a8fd0b0e2da564e12992314984b93517f","fetched_at":"2026-08-17T00:12:10Z","fingerprint":"b1b8d7fbe3e67e5e8d8c00657efc80e002553d707dca24952695e3e78c5203d8","id":"itm_2f60ab2fa7499677","item_id":"itm_2f60ab2fa7499677","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-17T00:03:37Z","reading_minutes":18,"score":94,"sort_at":"2026-08-17T00:03:37Z","source_id":"github","source_name":"GitHub","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"这份 2026-08-17 更新的 Safety-Guard Dynamics 研究仓库系统研究小型 safety guard 的微调迁移问题：作者用 Qwen2.5-1.5B、SmolLM2-1.7B、SmolLM3-3B、Qwen3-4B 四个固定 checkpoint 做 paired same-checkpoint 设计，比较 base 与 LoRA-SFT、KL-SFT、composition 和高合规领域评测。关键证据显示，普通 SFT 在 represented-source macro-AP 上平均提升 +0.3234，但 held-out transfer macro-AP 平均下降 -0.0589；在同等误报预算下，transfer recall 从 0.517 降到 0.185，HarmBench recall 从 0.780 降到 0.171。仓库还用 2275 行 ExpGuard finance/health/law 数据和 146 行 mortgage public_test 说明通用安全标签与领域政策违规并不等价。局限是多项结论属于 retrospective fixed-panel estimation，部分数据 gated 或 text-free，starting-type adaptation 存在 contract drift，因此不能把 benchmark gain 直接等同于可部署安全迁移。","tags":["AI安全","Safety Guard","LLM后训练","迁移评测","Agent安全","Benchmark"],"title":"Safety Benchmark Gains Do Not Guarantee Safety Transfer: A Comprehensive Study of Fine-Tuning Small Language Model Safety Guards for High-Compliance and General Safety Domains","title_hash":"6e666a344292aba07e43d734c858bca623b3c83c29c26bc8ee32a6d9740de87e","type":"report","url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/safety-guard-dynamics/commit/e9883b6a8fd0b0e2da564e12992314984b93517f"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_12650e7cb15091e1/index.md","canonical_url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2608.14277","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-08-17T12:15:00Z","content_hash":"b8525aa52b7b0057a24db8fc4f6fd28b9c9c887f3bcd06e5c930de849eb87d6f","evidence":[{"label":"Hugging Face Papers page","type":"url","url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2608.14277"},{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14277"},{"label":"SimpleOPD project page","type":"url","url":"https://hhnqqq.github.io/SimpleOPD-project-page/"},{"label":"Official implementation repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/hhnqqq/SimpleOPD"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.14277","fetched_at":"2026-08-17T12:15:00Z","fingerprint":"b8525aa52b7b0057a24db8fc4f6fd28b9c9c887f3bcd06e5c930de849eb87d6f","id":"itm_12650e7cb15091e1","item_id":"itm_12650e7cb15091e1","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","reading_minutes":18,"sort_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","source_id":"huggingface-papers","source_name":"Hugging Face Papers","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"SimpleOPD 研究如何把长上下文教师 SU-01 的数学证明推理能力，通过 on-policy distillation 迁移到上下文更短且 tokenizer 可能不同的学生模型。方法先让学生生成自己的 rollout，再把同一表面文本交给教师用原生 tokenizer 打分，只监督双方 token 占据完全相同文本 span 的位置；为避免直接 OPD 导致长度爆炸、truncation 和重复循环，论文加入 student-reference KL，并屏蔽 </think>、<|im_end|> 等终止 token 的优势。实验覆盖 Qwen3、Qwen3.5、Intern-S2、GLM-4.7、Gemma-4：Intern-S2-Preview 在 ProofBench 的 Gemini-2.5-Pro judge 复评中从 34.0 提到 55.2，增幅 21.2；主表中 Intern-S2-OPD ProofBench@4 从 21.70 到 44.50，接近 SU-01 的 45.00。局限是教师 SU-01 与完整训练流程未完全开放，训练数据集中在数学证明，ProofBench 依赖模型 judge，跨 tokenizer 差异较大的 Gemma 仍出现指标不均衡。","tags":["on-policy-distillation","post-training","long-context-reasoning","tokenizer-alignment","mathematical-reasoning"],"title":"SimpleOPD: Simple Tokenizer-Agnostic On-Policy Distillation for Long-Context Reasoning","title_hash":"317820c44d08ba5ff71289566f8ca60cb1b4d45032494a3e749154dc3de383ac","type":"paper","updated_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2608.14277"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_94c4a5c78741708b/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14391","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-17T04:32:25Z","content_hash":"bddcfe03f7de3912c105ec10145fdf50ad825ada63a3947bbb44cda882eab2c9","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv official paper page","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14391"},{"label":"Hugging Face Daily Papers date page","type":"url","url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/date/2026-08-17"},{"label":"RA-Bench official GitHub repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/24029100313/RA-Bench"},{"label":"RA-Bench Hugging Face dataset","type":"url","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/liangshuo0111/RA-Bench"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.14391v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-17T04:32:25Z","fingerprint":"bddcfe03f7de3912c105ec10145fdf50ad825ada63a3947bbb44cda882eab2c9","id":"itm_94c4a5c78741708b","item_id":"itm_94c4a5c78741708b","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-14T15:32:56Z","reading_minutes":18,"score":94,"sort_at":"2026-08-14T15:32:56Z","source_id":"arxiv-ra-bench","source_name":"arXiv / RA-Bench","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"RA-Bench 研究 AI 生成危机视频能否被现有检测器识别：作者以真实危机和社会重要事件视频为锚点，构造 17,886 条视频，包括 1,830 个真实锚点和 16,056 条由 4 个开源、5 个闭源生成器产生的配对视频；实验覆盖 7 个传统检测器、10 个 zero-shot 多模态模型和细调 MLLM 检测器。关键证据是传统检测器从公开参考 AUC 67.6-98.6% 掉到 RA-Bench 源级均值 43.9-57.3%，HumanProof 筛出 633 条被 5 名评审全部判真的生成视频，LastMile 完整传播链让细调 MLLM 平均 FakeR 从 46.0% 跌到 1.4%。局限是它仍主要覆盖视觉、I2V 和受控传播模拟，未完整覆盖音频伪造、多阶段编辑和真实社交语境。","tags":["AI Safety","Video Forensics","Benchmark","Deepfake Detection","RA-Bench"],"title":"Can We Defend Against AI-Generated Video Attacks on Real-World Crisis Events? A Systematic Evaluation of Detectors, Generators and Social Dissemination","title_hash":"7b60e58c795ae61a149646af9d8490ca4eb57aee24995413520885e508a81a15","type":"paper","updated_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14391"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_cfaf292b4bb0c460/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14354","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-08-17T10:45:26Z","content_hash":"f79de7aac4b15c191dfc0b0faf1db495955cd32d424c54e037b8b258653b92b1","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14354"},{"label":"arXiv cs.AI new listings for 2026-08-17","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/new?skip=0&show=2000"},{"label":"arXiv PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.14354"},{"label":"ScienceFlow project page","type":"url","url":"https://huawei-noah.github.io/noah-research/ScienceFlow/website/"},{"label":"Huawei Noah Chinese announcement","type":"url","url":"https://www.noahlab.com.hk/news/212"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.14354v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-17T10:45:26Z","fingerprint":"f79de7aac4b15c191dfc0b0faf1db495955cd32d424c54e037b8b258653b92b1","id":"itm_cfaf292b4bb0c460","item_id":"itm_cfaf292b4bb0c460","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-14T14:54:01Z","sort_at":"2026-08-14T14:54:01Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"ScienceFlow 是面向长程机器学习研究、科学发现和优化任务的 Agent 框架，把研究进展表示为可恢复的 executable state，并用 ESTRA 在研究片段边界选择当前或归档状态作为 anchor、决定继续或重定向；同时由 evidence-aware execution controller 管理作业准入、设备租约、在线观察和停止重规划。论文在完整 75 题 MLE-bench 上使用 DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Preview、24 小时预算、最多 2 GPU，取得 70.22±1.18% Any-Medal，比作者列出的最强已报告基线高 4.92 个百分点；Lite 消融中完整系统 24h 为 80.30±2.62%，去掉 ESTRA 为 66.67±2.62%，去掉执行控制为 69.70±5.25%。局限是部分遥测只覆盖 54/75 个任务，KTTSP 与 SciModelingBench 的统计强度有限，且不同基线预算和硬件不完全统一。","tags":["大模型Agent","长程科研Agent","MLE-bench","状态恢复","资源控制"],"title":"ScienceFlow: A long-horizon agent for ML research, scientific discovery and beyond","title_hash":"3c34eeb9bb11e26bf1bdb854f73f70b44ca65395b04b19227333967113a401c6","type":"paper","updated_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14354"}
